        <!-- Narrative hook -->
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold bg-red-500/20 text-red-300 border border-red-400/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-5" data-i18n="hero.badge">
          ⚠️ 12,000+ children go missing in India every month
        </span>

        <blockquote class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-4">
          "14 hours.<br/>No ID. No way<br/>to reach her family."
        </blockquote>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3">
          A 6-year-old went missing at Kumbh Mela. No phone, no voice, fourteen hours of terror before her family found her. One small tag would have ended it in 7 minutes.
        </p>
        <p class="text-teal-300 font-semibold text-xl mb-5" data-i18n="hero.tagline">
          SafeTag exists so this never happens to your family.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Every SafeTag has <strong class="text-white">two ways to save a life</strong>: a QR code any camera can scan, and a built-in RFID/NFC chip that works even if the QR is scratched or in darkness.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-7 mt-1 flex-wrap">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-teal-300 font-semibold">📷 QR Scan</span>
          <span class="text-slate-500">+</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-teal-300 font-semibold">📡 RFID/NFC Tap</span>
          <span class="text-slate-500">=</span>
